sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SummaryWorker@{ "type": "control" } as Summary service worker
    participant WebhookTask@{ "type": "queue" } as Webhook delivery task
    participant SummaryStore@{ "type": "database" } as Summary result store
    participant API@{ "type": "boundary" } as Dictaphone webhook endpoint
    participant DB@{ "type": "database" } as PostgreSQL
    participant Backend@{ "type": "control" } as Dictaphone backend worker
    participant Store@{ "type": "database" } as File data-policy bucket

    SummaryWorker->>WebhookTask: Queue call_webhook_v2_task(payload, tenant_id)
    WebhookTask->>WebhookTask: Resolve tenant webhook URL and API key
    WebhookTask->>API: POST /api/v1.0/ai-jobs/webhook/<br/>Authorization: Bearer webhook key
    API->>API: Verify shared webhook key and validate summary payload
    API->>DB: Find AiFileJob by remote_job_id

    alt Summary success webhook
        DB-->>API: Pending summary job
        API->>Backend: Enqueue store_summary(job_id, summary_data_url)
        API-->>WebhookTask: 200 Event processed
        Backend->>SummaryStore: GET signed summary URL
        SummaryStore-->>Backend: Summary text
        Backend->>DB: Resolve file and persisted storage policy
        Backend->>Store: PUT summaries/{ai_job_id}.txt
        Backend->>DB: Mark summary job SUCCESS
    else Summary failure webhook
        Note over WebhookTask,API: The same request carries status=failure and error_code.
        DB-->>API: Pending summary job
        API->>DB: Mark matching AI job FAILED
        API-->>WebhookTask: 200 Event processed
    else Unknown or already successful job
        API-->>WebhookTask: 200 Ignore event
    end

    Note over SummaryWorker,Store: Webhook delivery retries are handled by the summary service's Celery task. Result download and storage retries are handled by Dictaphone's task.

